          "title": "You'll want to know: ইস্তফা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ইস্তফা — istôphā — \"a resignation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মামা চাকরি থেকে ইস্তফা দিলেন। Māmā chākri theke istôphā dilen. My uncle resigned from his job."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With দেওয়া: ইস্তফা (istôphā) দেওয়া, to resign."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ইস্তফা (istôphā) is usually traced to Arabic istiʿfā, \"asking to be let off\", which reached Bengali through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
