          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ছাঁটাই করা — chhā̃ṭāi kôrā — \"to lay off (workers)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কারখানাটা পঞ্চাশজন মজুর ছাঁটাই করল। Kārkhānāṭā pônchāshjôn mojur chhā̃ṭāi kôrlô. The factory laid off fifty labourers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি দশজন কর্মী ছাঁটাই করলেন, tini dôshjôn kôrmī chhā̃ṭāi kôrlen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ছাঁটাই করা (chhā̃ṭāi kôrā) joins ছাঁটাই, \"a cutting back\", built on ছাঁটা, \"to trim\", to করা, \"to do\"; CDIAL lists Bengali chā̃ṭā, \"to lop\", under a reconstructed chāṇṭ, \"cut\" (CDIAL 5013). Of workers it means to lay them off."
            }
          ]
        },
